0, "end": 30, "text": "quiet and safe even at night ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02", "start": 31, "end": 81, "text": "FOOD Here is where I could end up writing a book ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02", "start": 82, "end": 98, "text": "Maybe I should !"}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02", "start": 99, "end": 100, "text": "!"}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02", "start": 101, "end": 209, "text": "I always say that there is no Italian cuisine as such and it would be more correct to say Italian cuisines ."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02", "start": 210, "end": 285, "text": "What you eat in Sicily is completely different than what you eat in Milan !"}, "D3S7": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02", "start": 286, "end": 401, "text": "I must admit that I did not know much about food from Friuli-Venezia Giulia and I fell completely in love with it ."}, "D3S8": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02", "start": 402, "end": 455, "text": "In our 3 week stay , we never had a single bad meal ."}, "D3S9": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d02", "start": 456, "end": 466, "text": "Every meal"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 0, "end": 169, "text": "Voghera Voghera (Vogherese dialect of Emilian: \"Vughera\"; Latin: \"Forum Iulii Iriensium\") is a town and \"comune\" in the Province of Pavia in the Italian region Lombardy."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 170, "end": 207, "text": "The population was 39,374 as of 2017."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 208, "end": 286, "text": "It is the third most populated town in the province, after Pavia and Vigevano."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 287, "end": 377, "text": "It is located 30 km south-southwest of that city, on the Staffora (a tributary of the Po)."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 378, "end": 491, "text": "It is the main town of Oltrepò Pavese, and is an important rail and road hub as well as a renowned wine producer."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 492, "end": 555, "text": "Known in ancient times as Iria, the town took its name from the"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 0, "end": 77, "text": "This is an underground sight , so we did not visit it – I am claustrophobic !"}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 78, "end": 181, "text": "On a side street alongside the bar is an unimpressive door which you can open onto the Ipogeo Celtico ."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 182, "end": 264, "text": "This is a series of rock chambers , or grottoes , carved close to the cliff face ."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 265, "end": 325, "text": "No-one knows how old the caves are , who dug them , or why ."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 326, "end": 433, "text": "As the name suggests , some think this is a pre-Roman Celtic site , perhaps intended for burials or rites ."}, "D5S6": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 434, "end": 499, "text": "Longobard Temple Continuing along Via Monastero Maggiore from the"}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00:c0", "entity": "Forum Iulii", "scope": "region", "claim": "The region of Forum Iulii is Friuli-Venezia Giulia.", "answer": "Friuli-Venezia Giulia", "quote": "Cividale del Friuli Cividale del Friuli ( (locally ); ; ) is a town and \"comune\" in the Province of Udine, part of the Friuli-Venezia Giulia region of northern Italy.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "card_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03:c0", "entity": "Forum Iulii", "scope": "region", "claim": "The region of Forum Iulii is Lombardy.", "answer": "Lombardy", "quote": "Voghera Voghera (Vogherese dialect of Emilian: \"Vughera\"; Latin: \"Forum Iulii Iriensium\") is a town and \"comune\" in the Province of Pavia in the Italian region Lombardy.", "original_document_number": 4}], "current_answers": ["Friuli-Venezia Giulia", "Lombardy"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Friuli-Venezia Giulia", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Lombardy", "origin": "initial"}]}
